<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Outokumpu.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Outokumpu.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Outokumpu Oy was rated &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs as the investment bank started coverage of the stock, Goldman said on Friday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
